(variable-mass)
*title Variable mass rocket
*atmos none
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0
*trajectory 1 vehicle start on 1
  *initial ecfc
    x=20925646.3255 y=0 z=0 xdt=0 ydt=0 zdt=0 time=0 mass=10
  *file variable-mass.dat
    time xecfc xecfcdt mass wt fuel thrust
  *segment 1 burn
    *integ dtprnt=0.25 dt=0.025
    *inertial ecfc
    *prop thrust=(constant-thrust) mdot=(burn-mdot)
    *fly yawi=0
    *fly pitchi=0
    *fly rolli=0
    *when time=5 stop
*end
